		(property "Description" "H2 rung-3 (owner ruling + coordinator part correction, 2026-07-03), DNP position-only: 28V-capable low-power boost (TPS61040, VIN 1.8-6V, 400mA switch limit, internal soft start) trickle-charges the 16V 4700uF reservoir toward ~11.5V for the V^2 energy win -- replaces the register's TPS61023 whose 5.5V VOUT ceiling could not serve the ~12V target. FB divider R31/R32 (DNP) sets VOUT = 1.233*(1+1M/120k) = 11.51V. No series charge-limit R needed: the part is peak-current-controlled (400mA switch limit + soft start), which is itself the trickle-charge limiter. SW carries a real no_connect (inductor + rectifier are OQ-56 bench work, not populated at this position-only pass)." (at 534.67 133.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
